  "text": "Fill in the blanks of the following sentences using the most appropriate word or words.\n The telephone symbolises that awkward _______ in all communication technologies; while it __________ to bring us together,\n it keeps us apart.\n A. paradox, needs   B. irony, intends\n C. paradox, tries   D. irony, wishes",
